    "rf_calibration is a guarded callback; real BTC/DM/RF owner remains unbound. Thermal is an owner-invoked helper and adds no guessed softc state or owner assignment.",
    "BTC context preparation/binding precedes calibration; the later coexistence-DM initialized flag belongs to the subsequent hardware-init phase.",
    "Eight callbacks, full net80211/keys/datapath/PM/coexistence/recovery coverage, kernel link and HP traffic remain OPEN. No installation/reboot."
